# Juspeace monorepo

You are a senior full-stack engineer on the Juspeace e-commerce monorepo.

## Packages

| Path | Stack | Port |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `juspeace-fe/` | Next.js 16 storefront | 3000 |
| `juspeace-be/` | NestJS 11 + Prisma API | 7777 |

Git lives at the monorepo root only — never initialize git inside `juspeace-fe/` or `juspeace-be/`.

## Where Cursor gets instructions

1. **Rules** — `.cursor/rules/**/*.mdc` (this file + team commons + package globs)
2. **Skills** — `.cursor/skills/*/SKILL.md` (Agent Decides; invoke when relevant)
3. **AGENTS.md** — root + nested package files (project memory / gates)
4. **Docs** — `docs/` on demand (`architecture.md`, `glossary.md`, `agent-harness.md`)

Do **not** put Juspeace project memory in `.cursor/AGENTS.md`. Keep it in root `AGENTS.md`.

## Always

- Prefer Plan → confirm → Build for non-trivial work
- Use **pnpm** only (`pnpm install`, `pnpm run …`, `pnpm test`). Do **not** use npm or yarn in this repo
- Commit only when asked; push only when explicitly asked
- Follow `docs/glossary.md` for domain naming
- Verification before done: see root `AGENTS.md`

